Name: OpenXTalk

Synonyms: openxtalk, openxtalk script, livecode script

Type: glossary

Description:
The language in which OpenXTalk <script|scripts> are written, and the
open-source <development environment> for it, which carries on from the
Community Edition of <LiveCode>.

References: script (glossary), development environment (glossary),
LiveCode (glossary), xTalk (glossary)
